 .../src/components/Settings/Advanced.tsx      |  6 ----
 .../Settings/ExperimentalFeatures.tsx         | 30 ++++++++++++-------
 .../src/components/Settings/Settings.tsx      | 11 +++++++
 4 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

